418 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 209 0 R
/T (In conclusion, this project allowed me to compare traditional machine learning and deep learning approaches for disaster tweet classification.  Although Logistic Regression achieved the best result with an F1-score of 0.7691, LSTM and GRU models still learned useful sequential information from text.  This project helped me better understand preprocessing, embeddings, sequence models, training, and evaluation in deep learning.)
/E (In conclusion, this project allowed me to compare traditional machine learning and deep learning approaches for disaster tweet classification.  Although Logistic Regression achieved the best result with an F1-score of 0.7691, LSTM and GRU models still learned useful sequential information from text.  This project helped me better understand preprocessing, embeddings, sequence models, training, and evaluation in deep learning.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
