905 0 obj
<<
/Title (In conclusion, this project allowed me to compare traditional machine learning and deep learning approaches for disaster tweet classification.  Although Logistic Regression achieved the best result with an F1-score of 0.7691, LSTM and GRU models still learned useful sequential information from text.  This project helped me better understand preprocessing, embeddings, sequence models, training, and evaluation in deep learning.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 442 0 R
>>
